      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787767546567,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "project-level questions:\n- how much can we get off-the-shelf? e.g. fcu, esc, bms\n- custom pcbs in scope?\n- university pcb resources?\n- custom escs?",
